<li>Abia (raja Yehuda)</li>
<li>Asa (raja Yehuda)</li>
<li>Baesa</li>
<li>Daud</li>
<li>Nadab (raja Israel)</li>
<li>Yerobeam bin Nebat</li>
<li>Bagian Alkitab yang berkaitan: 1 Raja-raja 14, 1 Raja-raja 16, 2 Tawarikh 13-16.</li>
